OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of money laundering
OL,4,Afor honeytrap killers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith money laundering and other alleged
OL,8,Foffences linked to crimes committed by
OL,9,Fa couple who drugged men seeking sexual
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FCalin Tudorache, 21, of New Barns
OL,13,FAvenue, Mitcham, has been charged with
OL,14,Fthree offences under the Proceeds of
OL,15,FCrime Act 2002.
OL,17,FThey relate to the crimes of Adina
OL,18,FMihai and Madlin Dumitru, who were each
OL,19,Fjailed for 17 years in August for the
OL,20,Fmanslaughter of two men and the
OL,21,Fpoisoning of two others.
